{"Date": "03/14/2022", "Record Number": "ZP2022-0042", "Record Type": "Zoning Permit", "Description": "To establish a temporary daytime drop-in center where services and support will be provided for unhoused community members in need of a place to gather during the daytime. Permanent site improvements to the vacant lot (37\u2019 x 135\u2019), facing Haste Street, include minor grading, retaining walls, fences, lighting, paving, landscaping and drainage. There would be no proposed structures that require a building permit. Temporary facilities would include a mobile trailer, deck, ramp, and portable restrooms, as well as benches, trash/recycling receptacles, and similar equipment. The day use center will be staffed at all times when it is open, limited to 8AM to 5PM. The temporary site features for the day-use operation will be removed after a 26-month period and other site improvements will remain for use of the site by the church according to the underlying use permit for the larger property.", "Project Name": "SACRED REST DROP-IN CENTER", "Status": "Approved", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "03/14/2022", "ZP2022-0042", "Zoning Permit", "To establish a temporary daytime drop-in center where services and support will be provided for unhoused community members in need of a place to gather during the daytime. Permanent site improvements to the vacant lot (37\u2019 x 135\u2019), facing Haste Street, include minor grading, retaining walls, fences, lighting, paving, landscaping and drainage. There would be no proposed structures that require a building permit. Temporary facilities would include a mobile trailer, deck, ramp, and portable restrooms, as well as benches, trash/recycling receptacles, and similar equipment. The day use center will be staffed at all times when it is open, limited to 8AM to 5PM. The temporary site features for the day-use operation will be removed after a 26-month period and other site improvements will remain for use of the site by the church according to the underlying use permit for the larger property.", "SACRED REST DROP-IN CENTER", "Approved", "", "", "", "2407 DANA St, BERKELEY CA 94704 United States"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=22PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=00213&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
